  "result": "Perfect! All 38 tests pass. I've added two line management functions:\n\n**addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })** \u2014 adds or updates a line:\n- Adds a new line at the end if the SKU isn't on the invoice\n- Increases the qty if the SKU already exists\n- Validates qty is a positive integer (QTY_INVALID)\n- Validates SKU exists in catalogue (UNKNOWN_SKU)\n- Refuses to edit if status isn't 'draft' (NOT_DRAFT)\n\n**removeLine(invoice, sku)** \u2014 removes a line:\n- Removes the line with that SKU\n- Returns LINE_NOT_FOUND if the SKU isn't on the invoice\n- Returns NO_LINES if it would remove the last line\n- Refuses to edit if status isn't 'draft' (NOT_DRAFT)\n\nBoth functions preserve immutability (don't mutate the input invoice) and return `ok(newInvoice)` or `fail(code)`.\n\nAdded error codes: **LINE_NOT_FOUND** and **NOT_DRAFT**\n\nAll 38 tests pass. \u2705",
